date_published": "2026-08-09T00:00:00+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://www.webnovel.win/blog/2026/08/08/legal-free-novels-txt-collections/", "url": "https://www.webnovel.win/blog/2026/08/08/legal-free-novels-txt-collections/", "title": "2026 \u5e74\u54ea\u91cc\u80fd\u5408\u6cd5\u514d\u8d39\u770b\u5c0f\u8bf4\uff1f\u516c\u7248\u3001\u4f5c\u8005\u6388\u6743\u4e0e TXT/\u7535\u5b50\u4e66\u8d44\u6e90\u76ee\u5f55", "content_html": "\u9762\u5411\u8bfb\u8005\u6574\u7406 2026 \u5e74\u4ecd\u53ef\u6838\u9a8c\u7684\u516c\u7248\u3001\u4f5c\u8005\u6388\u6743\u548c\u5f00\u653e\u6570\u5b57\u56fe\u4e66\u9986\u8def\u7ebf\uff0c\u5e76\u533a\u5206\u53ef\u4ee5\u76f4\u63a5\u8bfb\u3001\u53ea\u80fd\u8df3\u8f6c\u53d1\u73b0\u3001\u9700\u8981\u9010\u672c\u5224\u65ad\u7248\u6743\u548c\u76ee\u524d\u5c1a\u4e0d\u9002\u5408 WebNR \u76f4\u63a5\u5bfc\u5165\u7684\u6765\u6e90\u3002", "image": null, "date_modified": "2026-08-08T17:30:21+00:00", "date_published": "2026-08-08T00:00:00+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://www.webnovel.win/blog/2026/08/06/legado-source-guide/", "url": "https://www.webnovel.win/blog/2026/08/06/legado-source-guide/", "title": "2026 \u5e74 Legado \u4e66\u6e90\u5728\u54ea\u91cc\u627e\uff1f\u4e00\u4efd\u9762\u5411\u8bfb\u8005\u7684\u67e5\u627e\u4e0e\u9a8c\u6e90\u6307\u5357", "content_html": "\u8bf4\u660e\u5f53\u524d Legado \u4e66\u6e90\u7684\u67e5\u627e\u8def\u5f84\u3001\u6388\u6743\u4e0e\u5931\u6548\u98ce\u9669\u3001\u4e09\u7c7b\u5b89\u5168\u6765\u6e90\uff0c\u4ee5\u53ca\u5982\u4f55\u7528 WebNR \u7684\u9996\u4e2a CC0 \u793a\u4f8b\u4e66\u6e90\u9a8c\u8bc1\u5bfc\u5165\u6d41\u7a0b\u3002", "image": null, "date_modified": "2026-08-07T16:32:22+00:00", "date_published": "2026-08-06T00:00:00+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://www.webnovel.win/blog/2025/01/14/webnr-initial-release-archive/", "url": "https://www.webnovel.win/blog/2025/01/14/webnr-initial-release-archive/", "title": "WebNR initial release archive", "content_html": "<h1>WebNR initial release archive</h1>\n<p>This page records the original public release date. It is an archive, not a claim that every early prototype feature remains supported.</p>", "image": null, "date_modified": "2026-08-05T19:13:06+00:00", "date_published": "2025-01-14T00:00:00+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://www.webnovel.win/blog/2025/01/14/webnr-%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/", "url": "https://www.webnovel.win/blog/2025/01/14/webnr-%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/", "title": "WebNR \u521d\u59cb\u7248\u672c\u8bb0\u5f55", "content_html": "<h1>WebNR \u521d\u59cb\u7248\u672c\u8bb0\u5f55</h1>\n<p>\u672c\u9875\u8bb0\u5f55 WebNR \u6700\u521d\u7684\u516c\u5f00\u53d1\u5e03\u65e5\u671f\u3002\u5b83\u662f\u4e00\u4efd\u5386\u53f2\u8bb0\u5f55\uff0c\u5e76\u4e0d\u8868\u793a\u65e9\u671f\u539f\u578b\u4e2d\u63d0\u5230\u7684\u6bcf\u9879\u80fd\u529b\u4ecd\u7136\u53d7\u5230\u652f\u6301\u3002</p>", "image": null, "date_modified": "2026-08-05T19:13:06+00:00", "date_published": "2025-01-14T00:00:00+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://www.webnovel.win/blog/2025/02/27/7-web-novel-readers-compared-open-source-vs-commercial--2024-technical-deep-dive/", "url": "https://www.webnovel.win/blog/2025/02/27/7-web-novel-readers-compared-open-source-vs-commercial--2024-technical-deep-dive/", "title": "7 Web Novel Readers Compared: Open-Source vs Commercial | 2024 Technical Deep Dive", "content_html": "<h1>7 Web Novel Readers Compared: Open-Source vs Commercial | 2024 Technical Deep Dive</h1>\n<h2>Introduction</h2>\n<p>Web novel enthusiasts have a growing number of tools to streamline their reading experience. From mobile apps that aggregate chapters from fan-translation sites to official platforms with proprietary content, the ecosystem of <strong>web novel reader software</strong> is diverse. This post provides a developer-focused analysis of the most relevant projects \u2013 both open-source and commercial \u2013 comparing features, architectures, and target audiences. We'll break down how these competitors stack up against <strong>our project</strong> (a new entrant in this space), identifying strengths, gaps, and opportunities. Advanced users and potential contributors will gain insight into implementation details, scalability considerations, and best practices for building a web novel reader.</p>", "image": null, "date_modified": "2025-02-28T02:03:57+00:00", "date_published": "2025-02-27T00:00:00+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}]}